WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.366
Çekicin AI demo:

2
00:00:01.416 --> 00:00:04.696
we show what each link does, with its real output.

3
00:00:04.746 --> 00:00:06.561
Section one, customer demos.

4
00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:10.291
A photo of a damaged car goes to the Telegram assistant;

5
00:00:10.341 --> 00:00:14.887
in a few seconds the damage, the estimated cost and advice come back.

6
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.114
In the photo test on the website we upload the same photo:

7
00:00:18.164 --> 00:00:21.480
