8
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.174
twelve and a half to twenty-seven thousand lira.

9
00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:27.398
Switching the country to Germany shows the price in euros.

10
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:32.645
In the part price database, typing a car name lists the listings with photos and prices.

11
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.485
Section two, AI modules.

12
00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:41.065
The modules page shows the test accuracy and demo links of all six modules.

13
00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.147
In the simulator, changing the number of tow trucks

14
00:00:44.197 --> 00:00:46.983
recalculates waiting time and carbon emissions;

15
00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:48.237
this is a simulation.

16
00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:49.979
Section three, reports.

17
00:00:50.029 --> 00:00:52.852
The report page has a video and a PDF;

18
00:00:52.902 --> 00:00:55.498
every link in the PDF is clickable.

19
00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.501
Section four, the partnership programme:

20
00:00:59.551 --> 00:01:02.295
