21
00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:04.205
Section five, the admin panel.

22
00:01:04.255 --> 00:01:09.039
Logging in with the username and password from the message opens the project

23
00:01:09.089 --> 00:01:13.555
dashboard, with the start card on top and all pages grouped by section.

24
00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:17.455
Section six, site and technical links:

25
00:01:17.505 --> 00:01:20.599
the AI home page and the live API version.

26
00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:23.188
Under every link it says how to test it;

27
00:01:23.238 --> 00:01:26.164
